            <ArticleTitle>[The cardiac activity in patients with liver cirrhosis based on the data from 24-hour ECG monitoring].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>46-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>24-h ECG monitoring was performed in healthy subjects and patients with hepatic cirrhosis. Abnormalities rare in healthy individuals and frequent in the patients were registered. Cirrhosis patients presented marked changes in time parameters of cardiac performance.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
